            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:1",
            "summary": "“我”在一户人家讨饭被拒，看到男主人边吃肉饼边和“我”说话。",
            "function": "交代时间、地点和人物，引出故事"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:2",
            "summary": "男人认定“我”不想干活，其实“我”只想要吃的，并打算当晚搭车西行。",
            "function": "点出双方的误会和“我”的真实想法"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:3",
            "summary": "男人断言“我”有机会也不会干活。",
            "function": "继续写男人的偏见和盛气凌人"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:4",
            "summary": "“我”明白是男人挡着肉饼，便叹口气顺着他的话说。",
            "function": "交代“我”改口的原因"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:5",
            "summary": "“我”假意说自己当然想干活。",
            "function": "写“我”的应付之词"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:6",
            "summary": "男人让“我”第二天上午去某处搬砖。",
            "function": "男人给出干活的安排"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:7",
            "summary": "“我”答应一定到。",
            "function": "“我”继续假意应承"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:8",
            "summary": "男人继续吃饼，见“我”没走便质问。",
            "function": "推进情节，制造冲突"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:9",
            "summary": "男人问“我”还有什么事。",
            "function": "男人的质问"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:10",
            "summary": "“我”轻声说在等吃的。",
            "function": "“我”说出真实来意"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:11",
            "summary": "男人拒绝给吃的，夸自己勤劳诚实，称“我”只要肯干也能像他一样。",
            "function": "亮出男人的逻辑，为后文反驳作铺垫"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:12",
            "summary": "“我”反问是否像他一样。",
            "function": "“我”开始顺着他的话追问"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:13",
            "summary": "男人肯定地说像他一样。",
            "function": "男人确认自己的说法"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:14",
            "summary": "“我”追问是否所有人都能。",
            "function": "“我”把他的话推向所有人"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:15",
            "summary": "男人说所有人都能。",
            "function": "男人落入“我”的追问"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:16",
            "summary": "“我”指出要是人人都像他，就没人替他搬砖了。",
            "function": "用男人的逻辑反驳他，故事高潮"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-01-senior-three-january-survey-exam:reading-b:17",
            "summary": "妻子眼含笑意，男人大惊失色，原因“我”不得而知。",
            "function": "写二人的反应，收束全文"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
